  "id": "tax.us.2025.rule.schedule3-line1-direct-ftc",
  "notes": "Schedule 3 line 1 direct foreign tax credit without Form 1116 for the bounded 2025 class. v3 (final review): v2 minus the stale line 19 absence (requirement, pin and conditional member); the foreign tax credit never reads line 19. v2 (Track 1 contract item 1, Foreman's P0 correction): when the adopted Form 1099-DIV box-7 source set is closed with no foreign tax (box7-subtotal == 0), publishes $0 requiring only that closure -- the election and all 24 foreign-tax eligibility answers (including the 7 that v1 already required unconditionally via 'requires' alone, never read by its own when/value: no-sch3-line2..6, no-line17-schedule2-additional, no-line19-ctc-odc) are wrapped in a conditional_dependency_set (ADR-0037) activated only when box7-subtotal > 0, matching rule.schedule1a-part-v-line-36a's own pattern. Every other result of v1 is unchanged: when box7-subtotal > 0, the same election==yes, $300/$600 threshold, and 17 directly-checked scope-token compares gate the same min(box7-subtotal, line-16 regular tax) value, in the same order, over the same pins. Does not implement Form 1116, carryovers, or Schedule A deduction.",
